# Online Quiz Management System

![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Completed-success)
![Type](https://img.shields.io/badge/Type-Internship%20Project-blue)
![Tech](https://img.shields.io/badge/Stack-Full%20Stack-orange)

A complete **web-based Online Quiz Management System** developed as an internship project.  
It allows teachers to create and manage quizzes, and students to attempt them with real-time evaluation and instant results.

---

## 📋 Features

### Admin / Teacher
- Create, edit, and delete quizzes
- Add Multiple Choice, True/False & Subjective questions
- Set timer, total marks, and negative marking
- Publish / schedule quizzes
- View detailed student performance reports
- Manage question bank and categories

### Student
- Easy registration and secure login
- View available quizzes
- Timed quiz attempts with auto-submit
- Instant result and score display
- Attempt history and performance tracking

### System
- Role-based access control (Admin, Teacher, Student)
- Secure authentication (password hashing)
- Responsive design (Desktop + Mobile)
- Auto-save answers
- Export results (PDF / Excel ready)

